Subject: AUDIT 7.6 a compacted log's snapshot prepared when first asked, not at open
Why: A member that opened on a compacted log serialized its whole database into memory at open only to know the image's size (Amphora perf-H3); the machine states that size without making it, and the image is made the first time the core asks for a snapshot

